  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/fact-sheets/22-flsa-hours-worked" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Fact Sheet #22: Hours Worked Under the FLSA</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/subtitle-B/chapter-V/subchapter-B/part-785" rel="noopener">29 CFR Part 785 — Hours Worked</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/document/your-guide-employment-standards-act-0/hours-work" rel="noopener">Ontario — Employment Standards Act: Hours of Work</a></li>
  </ul>
</GuideLayout>
